OL,3,GNEWSAWork to preserve dead 'Robin Hood'
OL,4,Aoak tree begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPB said the works were designed
OL,7,Fto help keep the remaining structure
OL,8,F"stable and intact for as long as
OL,9,Fpossible, protecting both the tree and
OL,10,Fthe important wildlife habitat it
OL,11,Fcontinues to provide".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
